<title>ESTONIA: HOIU ASSET MANAGEMENT H1 NET PROFIT 14 MLN.</title>
<headline>HOIU ASSET MANAGEMENT H1 NET PROFIT 14 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hoiupank said on Monday that its Hoiupank asset management arm had a net profit of 14 million kroons in the first half of the year.  </p>
<p>&quot;The good results are due to the successful operation of our Russian fund...it generated most of our profits,&quot; the bank's asset management head Kristjan Hanni told Reuters.</p>
<p>Hanni added that its council will discuss raising its present 1997 profit estimate of 19 million kroons on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Hoiupank Asset Management had a net profit of 657,000 kroons in the same period last year.</p>
<p>-- Eva Palu, Tallinn newsroom, +372 6209 201, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
